<title>UK: UBS sets call warrants on Roche GS.</title>
<headline>UBS sets call warrants on Roche GS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland says it has issued 17.5 million American-style call warrants, on Roche GS.</p>
<p>100 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    10,500.00 SFR	   PREMIUM	10.9 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     6.72 SFR		  GEARING	14.9 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 26.NOV.96-21.NOV.97   PAYDATE	26.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   =			   MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  10,075.00 SFR</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
